    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A well-presented 3-bedroom semi-detached home in a cul-de-sac in the popular College Manor development.\r\nThis property offers spacious living areas, a private rear garden, and driveway to the front. It is in an excellent location close to Cobh town centre and most schools of the town.\r\n\r\nIt also enjoys excellent transport links, with a regular bus service to and from Cork City stopping right nearby.\r\nThe property features double glazing throughout and natural gas central heating.\r\n\r\nPerfect for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors, it combines comfort, practicality, and convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall\r\n4.65 x 1.83 - Laminated flooring\r\n\r\nLiving room\r\n5.16 x 3.11 - Laminated flooring, corner cast iron fireplace with timber surround.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C\r\n1.59 x 085 - Wc. Whb, tiled floor & half of wall tiled\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dinning\r\n3.74 – 5.10 - Ceramic tiled floors, build in units, patio door to the rear\r\nAppliances include: cooker, extractor, fridge/freezer\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (front) with ensuite\r\n5.06 x 2.96 - Laminate flooring & fitted slide robes\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n1.38 x 1.53 - Electric shower, wc, whb, fully tilled walls & floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (rear)\r\n3.26 x 2.78 - Laminate flooring & fitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (rear)\r\n3.07 x 2.25 - Laminate flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.63 x 1.99 - Fully tiled floors & walls, bath with shower tap, wc, whb, Hot-press\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nThe property benefits from a lawned garden with a Barna shed and convenient side entrance"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb location \r\nDriveway to the front\r\nEnclosed rear garden with side entrance\r\nBright spacious living accommodation\r\nWired for alarm\r\nDouble glazed windows throughout \r\nGas central heating\r\nAccess to floored attic for extra storage\r\nIdeal family home"
      },
